प्रति-√ रक्ष् P. -रक्षति, to preserve, guard, protect, AV.; MBh.;
to keep (a promise), MBh.;
to be afraid of, fear (acc.), VS.

प्रति-√ रुध् P. Ā. -रुणद्धि, -रुन्द्धे, or -रुन्धति, ˚ते, to check, hinder, prevent, oppose, resist, TS.; Br. &c.;
to confine, keep back, shut off, MBh.; BhP.;
to cover, conceal, MBh.; Hariv.

प्रति-√ रुह् P. -रोहति, to sprout or grow again, MBh. :
Caus. -रोपयति, to plant anything in its proper place, Var.;
to plant again (lit. and fig.), re-establish, Ragh.
